meta {
  name: List Users
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/private/users?page=1&pageSize=10
  body: none
  auth: none
}

params:query {
  page: 1
  pageSize: 10
  ~sortBy: email
  ~sortOrder: asc
  ~email: gmail
  ~role: ADMIN
  ~isValidated: true
}

docs {
  Requires an ADMIN session (run Public/Auth/Login (Admin) first). Anonymous -> 401, USER -> 403.

  Paginated envelope: { data, page, pageSize, total }. `total` reflects any applied filter.

  Sorting (toggle sortBy/sortOrder): sortBy in [createdAt, email]; sortOrder in [asc, desc] (default asc). A sortBy outside the list -> 400.

  Filtering (toggle any): email (contains), role (ADMIN | USER, exact), isValidated (bool). Unknown filter keys are ignored.
}
